              </span>
            </label>
          </li>
          <li class="deploy-checklist-item">
            <label class="deploy-checklist-label">
              <input type="checkbox" class="deploy-checklist-input" data-check-id="verify-queries">
              <span class="deploy-checklist-body">
                <span class="deploy-checklist-title">Verify queries return the required records</span>
                <span class="deploy-checklist-desc">Run or preview audience queries and confirm row counts and filters match the intended send population.</span>
              </span>
            </label>
          </li>
          <li class="deploy-checklist-item">
            <label class="deploy-checklist-label">
              <input type="checkbox" class="deploy-checklist-input" data-check-id="sf-tracking">
              <span class="deploy-checklist-body">
                <span class="deploy-checklist-title">Enable Send to Salesforce tracking (for IER creation)</span>
                <span class="deploy-checklist-desc">Turn on Send to Salesforce tracking on the journey email so Individual Email Results are created in Salesforce.</span>
              </span>
            </label>
          </li>
          <li class="deploy-checklist-item">
            <label class="deploy-checklist-label">
              <input type="checkbox" class="deploy-checklist-input" data-check-id="prod-cloudpages">
              <span class="deploy-checklist-body">
                <span class="deploy-checklist-title">Ensure Unsubscribe and Manage Preferences links go to Prod CloudPages</span>
                <span class="deploy-checklist-desc">Check footer links point to Production CloudPages URLs, not UAT or placeholder pages.</span>
              </span>
            </label>
          </li>
          <li class="deploy-checklist-item">
            <label class="deploy-checklist-label">
              <input type="checkbox" class="deploy-checklist-input" data-check-id="review-email">
              <span class="deploy-checklist-body">
                <span class="deploy-checklist-title">Review the email in the journey</span>
                <span class="deploy-checklist-desc">Open the email activity in Journey Builder and confirm content, links, and dynamic content render as expected.</span>
              </span>
            </label>
          </li>
          <li class="deploy-checklist-item">
            <label class="deploy-checklist-label">
              <input type="checkbox" class="deploy-checklist-input" data-check-id="subject-line">
              <span class="deploy-checklist-body">
                <span class="deploy-checklist-title">Confirm the subject line is correct (no UAT prefix)</span>
                <span class="deploy-checklist-desc">Verify the subject line matches Production standards and does not include UAT prefixes or test wording.</span>
              </span>
            </label>
          </li>
          <li class="deploy-checklist-item">
            <label class="deploy-checklist-label">
              <input type="checkbox" class="deploy-checklist-input" data-check-id="sender-profile">
              <span class="deploy-checklist-body">
                <span class="deploy-checklist-title">Confirm the sender profile is correct</span>
                <span class="deploy-checklist-desc">Validate From name, From address, and send classification match the approved Production sender profile.</span>
              </span>
            </label>
          </li>
          <li class="deploy-checklist-item">
            <label class="deploy-checklist-label">
              <input type="checkbox" class="deploy-checklist-input" data-check-id="email-test">
              <span class="deploy-checklist-body">
                <span class="deploy-checklist-title">Validate a successful email test</span>
                <span class="deploy-checklist-desc">Send a test to a subscribed contact. Some AMPscript issues do not surface as errors in Marketing Cloud; if the test will not deploy, AMPscript may be faulty or the contact may be unsubscribed.</span>
              </span>
            </label>
          </li>
          <li class="deploy-checklist-item">
            <label class="deploy-checklist-label">
              <input type="checkbox" class="deploy-checklist-input" data-check-id="confirm-tracking">
              <span class="deploy-checklist-body">
                <span class="deploy-checklist-title">Confirm tracking after deployment</span>
                <span class="deploy-checklist-desc">One-time sends: verify within the hour or by the next day. Features or automations from other systems: verify within the same week.</span>
