          </li>
          <li class="deploy-checklist-item">
            <label class="deploy-checklist-label">
              <input type="checkbox" class="deploy-checklist-input" data-check-id="bcc-address">
              <span class="deploy-checklist-body">
                <span class="deploy-checklist-title">Add a BCC address if needed to track deployments</span>
                <span class="deploy-checklist-desc">Configure BCC on the triggered send when you need a copy of production sends for monitoring.</span>
              </span>
            </label>
          </li>
          <li class="deploy-checklist-item">
            <label class="deploy-checklist-label">
